 (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ACN\" title=\"Accenture plc\">ACN</a>) <span class=\"green\">+10%</span>. <br/><br/><strong>Top S&amp;P 500 Losers</strong><br/>Ciena (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CIEN\" title=\"Ciena Corporation\">CIEN</a>) <span class=\"red\">-26%</span>. Coherent (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/COHR\" title=\"Coherent Corp.\">COHR</a>) <span class=\"red\">-26%</span>. Lumentum Holdings (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/LITE\" title=\"Lumentum Holdings Inc.\">LITE</a>) <span class=\"red\">-25%</span>. Hewlett Packard Enterprise (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/HPE\" title=\"Hewlett Packard Enterprise Company\">HPE</a>) <span class=\"red\">-25%</span>. Skydance (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SKYD\" title=\"Paramount Skydance Corporation\">SKYD</a>) <span class=\"red\">-25%</span>. <br/><br/><i>Where will the markets be headed next week? Current trends and ideas? Add your thoughts <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4954971-what-moved-markets-this-week\">to the comments section.</a></i></span></p> </div></body></html>",
